shedAt":"2026-09-16T12:05:50Z","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:40:09Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T16:19:18Z","openIssues":0,"description":"","snapshotDate":"2026-09-16","defaultBranch":"dev"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"大家好，自荐一个我最近做的开源工具 Grove：一个 macOS 原生的 Git worktree 可视化管理应用。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11755","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/codeacme17","githubUrl":"https://github.com/codeacme17/grove","externalId":"11755","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-16T12:28:48Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_109680f82262f0617375a608","projectPath":"/projects/codeacme17/grove/","trendDate":"2026-09-16","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/homebrew/brewui","tags":["github-trending","daily","Swift"],"title":"Homebrew / BrewUI","author":"Homebrew","github":{"url":"https://github.com/Homebrew/BrewUI"},"metrics":{"lang":"Swift","forks":31,"stars":1388,"today":271},"summary":"📺 Homebrew's official macOS GUI","sourceId":"github-trending","authorUrl":"https://github.com/Homebrew","githubUrl":"https://github.com/homebrew/brewui","externalId":"daily-Homebrew/BrewUI","sourceName":"GitHub Trending","publishedAt":null,"sourceIds":["github-trending"],"productId":"prd_179685fe5977a522db96dd9f","projectPath":"/projects/homebrew/brewui/","trendDate":"2026-09-16","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/guokuaile/tally","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【开源自荐】Tally：把 Claude Code / Codex 会话状态和 AI 配额放进 MacBook 刘海","author":"guokuaile","github":{"url":"https://github.com/guokuaile/tally","name":"guokuaile/tally","forks":0,"stars":1,"topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","appkit","claude","claude-code","claude-usage","codex","developer-tools","dynamic-island","llm","macbook-notch","macos","macos-app","menubar","monitoring","notch","quota","swift","swiftui","usage-tracking"],"license":"GPL-3.0","archived":false,"homepage":"https://github.com/guokuaile/tally/blob/main/README.en.md","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-15T03:13:26Z","createdAt":"2026-09-14T03:21:16Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T03:13:29Z","openIssues":0,"description":"Claude Code & Codex session status and AI usage quotas in your MacBook notch. 把 Claude Code / Codex 会话状态和各家 AI 配额（Claude、Codex、Cursor、Kimi、GLM…）放进刘海。SwiftUI + AppKit，零依赖。","snapshotDate":"2026-09-15","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"同时开着几个 Claude Code / Codex 会话时，得不停切窗口看谁在等审批、谁跑完了，配额快见底了也不知道。Tally 是一个 macOS 原生小工具，把这些放进 MacBook 的刘海里：平时和刘海融为一体，有会话等你或跑完了才往下垂一条提示；鼠标停上去展开成面板。 会话按「等你 / 在跑 / 最近」分组；等审批、等输入、跑完了，刘海垂一条提示并响一声。按 Esc 打断、API 报错、主回合结束后子 agent 还在后台跑，这些 hook 不上报的情况也判得准。 点一行跳回那个会话所在的终端标签（Ghostty、Terminal、iTerm2，tmux 的 pane 也行），关掉的会话一键接着聊。 各家配额摆一排：Claude、Codex、Cursor、Antigravity，加上 DeepSeek、Kimi、智谱 GLM、New API 中转站余额；Claude 和 Codex 有今日 / 本周花费和配速线，过 80% 和用完都会提醒。 顺带网速与代理、内存电池、在跑的 app、文件架、合盖不休眠，和一只跟着 CPU 忙闲变化的菜单栏小恐龙。 SwiftUI + AppKit，零第三方依赖；只读各家登录留下的 token，不刷新、不写钥匙串，没有统计上报。要求 macOS 15+、Apple Silicon、带刘海的 MacBook。GPL-3.0 开源，Homebrew 一条命令安装：brew install --cask guokuaile/tally/tally。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11709","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/guokuaile","githubUrl":"https://github.com/guokuaile/tally","externalId":"11709","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-15T03:25:35Z","sourceIds":["hellogithub-issues","weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_07f9523936bb25c466640495","projectPath":"/projects/guokuaile/tally/","trendDate":"2026-09-15","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/jamesryanatx/fcbnerd","tags":["showhn"],"hnUrl":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49705442","title":"Show HN: Macros with a Behringer FCB1010 MIDI Pedalboard in macOS","author":"fretlessjazz","github":{"url":"https://github.com/JamesRyanATX/fcbnerd","name":"JamesRyanATX/fcbnerd","forks":1,"stars":58,"topics":["fcb1010","macos","midi"],"license":"MIT","archived":false,"homepage":"","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-15T15:18:21Z","createdAt":"2026-09-14T21:33:23Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T21:13:35Z","openIssues":0,"description":"Do things with a Behringer FCB1010 MIDI pedalboard in MacOS","snapshotDate":"2026-09-15","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"points":83,"comments":21},"summary":"Do things with a Behringer FCB1010 MIDI pedalboard in MacOS","sourceId":"showhn","authorUrl":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=fretlessjazz","githubUrl":"https://github.com/jamesryanatx/fcbnerd","externalId":"49705442","sourceName":"Show HN","publishedAt":"2026-09-14T23:01:36Z","sourceIds":["showhn"],"productId":"prd_b53fd761e9606ef7be38750b","projectPath":"/projects/jamesryanatx/fcbnerd/","trendDate":"2026-09-15","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/gentpan/quotabar","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【开源自荐】QuotaBar：在 Mac 菜单栏和刘海上看 Claude Code / Codex / Cursor 的额度还剩多少","author":"gentpan","github":{"url":"https://github.com/gentpan/QuotaBar","name":"gentpan/QuotaBar","forks":1,"stars":19,"topics":[],"license":"MIT","archived":false,"homepage":"https://quota.bar","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-15T20:46:26Z","createdAt":"2026-08-26T18:02:03Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T00:17:38Z","openIssues":1,"description":"Every AI coding limit, in your menu bar. macOS menu-bar meter for Claude, Codex, Gemini, Cursor, Grok and more.","snapshotDate":"2026-09-15","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"QuotaBar 是一个 macOS 菜单栏应用，显示 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Gemini 等 AI 编程服务的额度用了多少、什么时候重置，并根据本地日志估算花了多少钱。与 GitHub 上另一款同名项目 nmsn/quota-bar 无关；本项目为 gentpan/QuotaBar。 <img width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\" alt=\"QuotaBar：菜单栏、刘海岛、屏幕边缘停靠条和桌面卡片\" src=\" /> 为什么做 我同时在用 Claude Code、Codex 和 Cursor，每家都有 5 小时窗口、周额度或月度额度，想知道还剩多少，只能挨个打开网页控制台。经常写到一半才发现额度用完了。于是做了一个工具，把所有额度放在抬眼就能看到的地方。 功能 23 个服务商：Claude、Codex、Cursor、Gemini、GitHub Copilot、Kimi、智谱 GLM、DeepSeek、OpenRouter 等（部分标为实验性）。Claude、Codex、Cursor 等直接复用命令行工具已有的登录，不用填任何东西。 四个位置随你选：菜单栏图标 + 下拉面板、刘海两侧（悬停展开）、屏幕边缘停靠条、桌面卡片。 节奏判断：进度条上标出匀速使用时此刻应在的位置，预计重置前会用完时提前提醒，并给出用完时间。 花费估算：读取 Claude Code、Codex CLI、OpenCode 的本地会话日志，按公开价格估算今日、昨日、30 天的花费，可按模型拆分，支持人民币等货币。 分享卡片：一周或一个月的用量生成图片。 服务状态：读取各家官方状态页，服务出问题时直接显示在卡片上。 <img width=\"372\" alt=\"QuotaBar 下拉面板（真实截图）\" src=\" /> 隐私 默认在本机读取和计算，不用注册账号，没有统计和遥测。只有主动加入 Quota Run 时才上传额度读数等（凭据、提示词、代码、路径不上传）。手动填写的密钥存在 macOS 钥匙串里。 安装 shell brew tap gentpan/tap brew trust gentpan/tap brew install --cask quotabar 或从 Releases 下载 dmg。需要 macOS 14+，支持 Apple 芯片和 Intel，经过 Apple 公证，中英文界面。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11698","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/12d339e3716a113ccd86bc1db8177a78c4340d083de19bcdb120533877c74fbc.png","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/gentpan","githubUrl":"https://github.com/gentpan/quotabar","externalId":"11698","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-14T23:24:07Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_bad839d82f5de53663958dd0","projectPath":"/projects/gentpan/quotabar/","trendDate":"2026-09-15","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/gentpan/openstats","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【开源自荐】OpenStats：Mac 菜单栏系统监控，能看 CPU / 网速 / 温度，也能调风扇、防休眠、清缓存","author":"gentpan","github":{"url":"https://github.com/gentpan/OpenStats","name":"gentpan/OpenStats","forks":4,"stars":42,"topics":["activity-monitor","appkit","apple-silicon","cpu-monitor","fan-control","gpu-monitor","keep-awake","liquid-glass","macos","macos-app","menu-bar-app","menubar","network-monitor","smc","swift","swiftui","system-monitor","temperature"],"license":"MIT","archived":false,"homepage":"https://getopenstats.com","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-15T20:56:34Z","createdAt":"2026-09-12T21:44:17Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T00:28:19Z","openIssues":0,"description":"轻量原生的 macOS 菜单栏系统监控：CPU、GPU、内存、网络、温度，支持风扇调速与防休眠。Swift 6 + SwiftUI，液态玻璃界面。","snapshotDate":"2026-09-15","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"大家好，我是 OpenStats 的开发者，想自荐一个开源的 macOS 菜单栏工具。 想在菜单栏抬眼就看到 CPU、风扇、网速，发现问题后直接调风扇、合盖继续跑、清缓存——所以做了这个中文优先、把「看」和「做」放在一起的工具。 菜单栏九种风格：CPU / GPU / 内存 / 网速 / 磁盘 / 电池 / 温度 / 风扇，双行文字、圆环、饼图、柱状历史等可整体或单项指定；数字等宽，刷新不抖动。 详情弹窗：核心热力图、流量历史与 ping、内存水位、电池与蓝牙外设电量等，区块可关。 温度与风扇：读全部传感器；自动 / 降温 / 强冷 / 自定义四种模式，退出后风扇自动恢复。 防休眠与清理：合盖继续跑任务；按类别清理缓存 / 日志 / 安装包等，清理前二次确认。 进程与本机解释：右键「用 Apple 智能解释」由系统本机模型说明（需 macOS 26，不联网）。 隐私与平台：数据本机读取，无统计上报；仅公网 IP 归属地查询与可选 ping 可联网（可关）。Swift + SwiftUI，无第三方 Swift 包依赖；SMC/风扇相关逻辑参考并移植自 exelban/stats（MIT）。MIT 开源，Developer ID 签名并公证。macOS 14+，Apple Silicon 上开发测试，Intel 风扇与温度未验证。界面有简体中文和英文。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11697","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/5a951b82978cdbcd3b4a0a96f4c38e5ba510074ab731dc53540862c4f0a43a21.png","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/gentpan","githubUrl":"https://github.com/gentpan/openstats","externalId":"11697","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-14T23:22:24Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_de49d8f0be43f8311d43a855","projectPath":"/projects/gentpan/openstats/","trendDate":"2026-09-15","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/zingerlittlebee/heeler","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【开源自荐】Heeler：一个面向 iPhone 和 iPad 的原生编程 Agent 控制台，基于 herdr","author":"ZingerLittleBee","github":{"url":"https://github.com/ZingerLittleBee/Heeler","name":"ZingerLittleBee/Heeler","forks":24,"stars":334,"topics":["ai-agents","apns","coding-agents","herdr","herdr-plugin","ios","libghostty","push-notifications","ssh","swift","swiftui","terminal"],"license":"Apache-2.0","archived":false,"homepage":"https://heeler.bybee.dev","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-13T15:26:45Z","createdAt":"2026-07-18T01:49:37Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T00:44:44Z","openIssues":33,"description":"Native iOS agent console for herdr — watch and drive the coding agents on your machines over SSH, with a real libghostty terminal, QR pairing, and push notifications when an agent needs you","snapshotDate":"2026-09-14","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"GitHub TestFlight： App Store 下载： （CN 未在 App Store 上架，请使用 TestFlight。）","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11687","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/00f05b6bce9a5b0666a06102795c25113fce1130eb6f498920819b0fdbd0e222.png","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/ZingerLittleBee","githubUrl":"https://github.com/zingerlittlebee/heeler","externalId":"11687","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-14T11:21:50Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_cb51691ee1ec7d627f0b41ed","projectPath":"/projects/zingerlittlebee/heeler/","trendDate":"2026-09-14","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/callbacked/kinesis","tags":["showhn"],"hnUrl":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49695408","title":"Show HN: Kinesis – Control your Mac with the Meta Neural Band","author":"callbacked","github":{"url":"https://github.com/callbacked/kinesis","name":"callbacked/kinesis","forks":3,"stars":54,"topics":["emg","gesture-control","human-computer-interaction","wearables"],"license":"","archived":false,"homepage":"","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-14T14:06:36Z","createdAt":"2026-09-14T11:30:54Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T03:03:30Z","openIssues":0,"description":"native macos controls for the meta neural band","snapshotDate":"2026-09-14","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"points":110,"comments":35},"summary":"a couple hours ago i had astra take on a 10 month old repo of mine https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;callbacked&#x2F;neural-band-poc&#x2F; that involved finding a way to use the meta neural band independently from the glasses to read the sEMG data off of it. i really think it is a cool piece of technology that largely gets overlooked by the glasses, and always thought it was a shame it couldn&#x27;t be used outside of its main application. after making quick work of that, i wanted to use it to control my mac using gesture controls and that&#x27;s how kinesis was 