ate":"2026-09-07","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"<img width=\"1417\" height=\"280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\" /> 送给用 丐版Codex（Plus版本）的兄弟们，Codex的5小时重置太烦了， 让我总要等5小时才能继续Coding，半夜爬起来只为了去Codex里输入个「继续」，我想好好睡觉。 我用Codex写了一个帮你鞭策 Codex 继续干活的小工具 【Codex Reset】。 它会监控你的用量窗口、找出被用量限制而中断暂停的任务对话，并在额度恢复的那一刻向Codex发送「继续」的指令，实现自动化催 AI 干活。 🤣 就是这么一个小痛点写的小东西，不知有没有兄弟用， 最起码不用老惦记着今天的活，明天起床还没干完10%。 👉Github开源地址 👀下载 Codex Reset 体验 <img width=\"2048\" height=\"1218\" alt=\"Image\" src=\" />","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11543","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/8a5e75cd02eb595aa080a24034bdbeaae1a575deaa877b068d22a27e23695724.png","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/boyso","githubUrl":"https://github.com/boyso/codex-reset","externalId":"11543","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T07:52:46Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_def273bc166f044643953b1b","projectPath":"/projects/boyso/codex-reset/","trendDate":"2026-09-07","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/yudaotor/lyrimuse","tags":["hellogithub","submission"],"title":"[开源推荐] Lyrimuse：一个智能匹配歌词的 macOS 桌面歌词工具（自荐）","author":"Yudaotor","github":{"url":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse","name":"Yudaotor/lyrimuse","forks":0,"stars":34,"topics":["apple-music","desktop-lyrics","dynamic-island","karaoke","kugou","lastfm","listenbrainz","lyrics","macos","menu-bar-app","music","netease-cloud-music","notch","now-playing","qq-music","scrobbler","spotify","swift","swiftui","youtube-music"],"license":"GPL-3.0","archived":false,"homepage":"https://yudaotor.github.io/lyrimuse/","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-09T01:04:59Z","createdAt":"2026-07-10T16:23:05Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T18:42:18Z","openIssues":0,"description":"Word-synced desktop lyrics on macOS for Apple Music, Spotify, QQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music, Kugou — and YouTube Music / Spotify Web in any browser. Actively maintained open-source LyricsX alternative. Floating overlay, Dynamic Island, menu bar or lyrics window; translation, romanization, Last.fm stats. | macOS 桌面歌词：逐字同步 · 翻译 · 粤拼 · LyricsX 替代","snapshotDate":"2026-09-09","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"一个常驻 macOS 菜单栏的桌面歌词工具。它同时向九个歌词源发起查询，把所有候选放在同一套标准下打分后再决定用哪份，避免现场版配上录音室歌词、粤语版配上国语歌词这类错配。除 Apple Music、Spotify 外，也能读取 QQ 音乐、网易云音乐、酷狗，以及浏览器里播放的网页版音乐。 亮点 歌词智能匹配，而且过程可查：九个源（网易云、QQ 音乐、酷狗、酷我、咪咕、Musixmatch、LRCLIB、LyricFind、AMLL）的全部候选统一打分——歌名/歌手/专辑吻合度、源上报时长与实际曲长的差、有没有逐字时间轴，Live/Remix/(Edit) 这类版本标记单独计分。每首歌都能点开看各候选得了多少分、赢家为什么赢，手动选定的会被锁定不被覆盖。同类项目多是「哪个源先返回就用哪个」。 国产播放器是一等公民：QQ 音乐、网易云、酷狗与 Apple Music、Spotify 同等支持，可多选；浏览器里的网页版音乐也能按页面进度条同步。 支持中文翻译、粤语粤拼、日语注音假名；翻译默认走 macOS 设备端翻译，歌词不出本机。 支持 Last.fm 记录播放，带本地听歌统计、榜单和全年热力图；没连账号也先记在本地，之后连上自动补传。 四种显示形态任意组合：桌面悬浮窗、贴着刘海的灵动岛胶囊、菜单栏歌词（可双排）、仿 Apple Music 的独立歌词窗口。 免费、GPL-3.0、无账号无遥测，Apple Silicon 与 Intel 都有构建。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/521xueweihan/HelloGitHub/issues/3662","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/ace4c3da9e5066498577945455d4072d9e4aee64ae9992d1b2af3434e55a9199.png","sourceId":"hellogithub-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor","githubUrl":"https://github.com/yudaotor/lyrimuse","externalId":"3662","sourceName":"HelloGitHub·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-08T18:09:56Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_f28acb2810ddbb1ef5925a49","projectPath":"/projects/yudaotor/lyrimuse/","trendDate":"2026-09-07","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/shenxianpeng/keelhaven","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【开源自荐】Keelhaven：macOS 菜单栏的 restic 备份工具","author":"shenxianpeng","github":{"url":"https://github.com/shenxianpeng/keelhaven","name":"shenxianpeng/keelhaven","forks":2,"stars":17,"topics":["backup","backup-tool","encryption","macos","macos-app","menubar-app","restic","restic-gui","s3","security-by-default","swiftui","time-machine-alternative"],"license":"GPL-3.0","archived":false,"homepage":"https://keelhaven.app","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-07T18:40:34Z","createdAt":"2026-08-26T01:51:13Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-08T03:23:55Z","openIssues":9,"description":"Privacy-first macOS menu-bar backup app powered by restic","snapshotDate":"2026-09-06","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"Keelhaven 是一个纯菜单栏的 macOS 备份应用，没有 Dock 图标，也没有主窗口。备份引擎是 restic，加密、去重、增量都交给它，Keelhaven 负责界面、定时和密码管理。 用起来是三步：选要保护的文件夹，选一个自己拥有的存储（外置硬盘、NAS/SFTP，或者任意 S3 协议的对象存储，比如 Backblaze B2、Wasabi、Cloudflare R2），再设一个定时（每小时/每天/每周）。设好之后它就在后台安静地跑，只有出错才弹通知。 仓库密码只存在 macOS 钥匙串里，不落盘、不写日志，也不会作为命令行参数传给 restic 子进程。写出来的是标准的 restic 仓库，哪天不用 Keelhaven 了，用 restic 命令行本身也能继续读取和恢复。 restic 需要访问任意目录、网络和 SSH，App Store 的沙盒放不下，所以目前只有 Homebrew 和一行 curl 脚本两种安装方式。还没有申请 Apple 开发者证书：Homebrew 安装会在安装时清掉隔离标记，能直接打开；如果是从网站下载 dmg 双击安装，首次需要手动允许一次。GPLv3 开源，界面支持中英文双语。 <img width=\"880\" alt=\"Keelhaven 菜单栏面板、新建计划向导、按时间点恢复的三个窗口\" src=\" /> brew install --cask shenxianpeng/tap/keelhaven 如果没有 Homebrew 可以通过 curl 命令来安装 curl -fsSL | bash","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11514","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/0b88df8eb0ca6e62262f36d702ac9454e6bae10d9ad4a36feaf31b0048ae7f32.png","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/shenxianpeng","githubUrl":"https://github.com/shenxianpeng/keelhaven","externalId":"11514","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-05T22:25:31Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_bce75aba69a218a613e9cbc4","projectPath":"/projects/shenxianpeng/keelhaven/","trendDate":"2026-09-06","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/betayao/seahelm","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【开源自荐】Seahelm：macOS 原生的 coding agent 控制台，一个窗口管多个 Claude Code / Codex","author":"BetaYao","github":{"url":"https://github.com/BetaYao/seahelm","name":"BetaYao/seahelm","forks":2,"stars":15,"topics":["ai-agents","appkit","claude-code","codex","coding-agent","developer-tools","ghostty","git-worktree","macos","swift","terminal","vibe-coding"],"license":"MIT","archived":false,"homepage":"https://www.seahelm.dev","language":"Swift","pushedAt":"2026-09-08T09:51:55Z","createdAt":"2026-06-25T03:35:23Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-08T09:53:30Z","openIssues":2,"description":"A native macOS workspace for coding agents — every git worktree a row on one roster, one agent to a split pane. Built on Ghostty, sessions persist through zmx.","snapshotDate":"2026-09-04","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"同时开五六个 Claude Code / Codex 在不同 git worktree 里干活的时候，最大的问题不是工具不好用，而是不知道该看哪个窗口。终端长得都一样，只能一个个切过去看最后一行输出。tmux 能管窗口，但它不知道「agent 在等你确认」这件事，对 tmux 来说卡在权限询问的 Claude 和正在写代码的 Claude 没有区别。 Seahelm 把这件事变成一眼可见：每个 repo 一个 tab，每个 git worktree 一张卡片，卡片上只显示 running / waiting / broken 三种状态。 技术上有两点可能值得一提。 一是终端渲染直接嵌了 libghostty（Ghostty 的 C 接口），Swift + AppKit，不是 Electron，延迟和渲染是原生终端的水平。会话持久化用 zmx，退出 App 或者重启电脑之后 agent 还在原地。 二是状态判断做成了一个优先级梯子：进程退出状态 > OSC 133 shell 集成标记 > 文本正则匹配。正则那一层是数据驱动的，每个 agent 一份 JSON manifest，可以在 ~/.config/seahelm/agents/ 下覆盖。Claude Code 和 Codex 接了原生 hook，所以「在等你」是一个真实事件，不是从屏幕文字猜出来的。目前 12 个 agent 有状态识别：claude、codex、opencode、gemini、cursor、aider、amp、cline、goose、kiro、pi、agent。 另外 agent 可以反过来操作它。每个 pane 都有 SEAHELMPANEID，配一个控制 socket 和 CLI： seahelm pane split <pane> --direction right seahelm pane run <pane> \"npm test\" seahelm wait agent-status <pane> --status Idle 所以一个 agent 能自己开一个兄弟 pane、把活派过去、然后等它做完。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11503","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/ab19c3dc8321dee22d48a299fa7675398b4ed059b5898fb715095f05c97a50a3.svg","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/BetaYao","githubUrl":"https://github.com/betayao/seahelm","externalId":"11503","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-04T12:29:48Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_7ff0415c97cf26708197cb75","projectPath":"/projects/betayao/seahelm/","trendDate":"2026-09-04","taxonomy":{"languages":["swift"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/chen2he/orange-cloud","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","official","工具"],"title":"Orange Cloud","auth